    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ee2614224325ea70342a63</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ee2614224325ea70342a63</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Oct 2025 10:30:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>自2019年诞生以来，SEA BEYOND项目始终以提升海洋素养为核心使命。于10月10日启幕的“SEA BEYOND：PRADA荣宅看见海洋”活动不仅包括了联合国教科文组织政府间海洋学委员会（UNESCO-IOC）策划的巡展“海洋与气候村”，还回顾了SEA BEYOND自启动以来的里程碑项目，并展出了艾美奖提名生态摄影师Enzo Barracco的海洋摄影作品。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本季Prada品牌播客，我们将与马伊琍、乔方利、Enzo Barracco、张敬宜和张之琪一起，从“SEA BEYOND：PRADA荣宅看见海洋”活动出发，走出城市的视野，重新锚定我们与海洋的关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>– 互动方式 –</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5813211408" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5813211408"><span>微博</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bdd17b66c202a000160f944?xsec_token=YBUSv02cKCSIfihqCaR9TWOFmixLa8Fao8RmdrkQxg3Ks=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=565967e8a40e18678a732b48&amp;apptime=1735305097&amp;share_id=9b85231596ed466888fb0aabc5c461c0" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bdd17b66c202a000160f944?xsec_token=YBUSv02cKCSIfihqCaR9TWOFmixLa8Fao8RmdrkQxg3Ks=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=565967e8a40e18678a732b48&amp;apptime=1735305097&amp;share_id=9b85231596ed466888fb0aabc5c461c0"><span>小红书</span></a><span>、微信公众号、微信视频号、</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iUwr2KYq/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/iUwr2KYq/"><span>抖音</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://m.douban.com/people/138215909/?_i=5305403QOPennN" data-url="https://m.douban.com/people/138215909/?_i=5305403QOPennN"><span>豆瓣</span></a><span>等平台搜索“Prada普拉达”，关注更多品牌动态。</span></p>]]></description>
